Attenora — third-party notices
================================

Attenora ships no third-party code, fonts or images at runtime. The only
attribution it carries is for the *geometry* of its icon set, which is derived
from Lucide.


Lucide
------
Applies to: app/src/main/java/dev/opensource/attenora/ui/icons/FgIcons.kt

The outline paths in Attenora's icon set follow Lucide's 24x24 grid, stroke
weight and rounded joins, and several paths are derived from Lucide's own
geometry (for example `gauge`, `layout-grid` and `hourglass`). They are
re-implemented here as Compose `ImageVector` builders rather than copied as
files, but the shapes originate from Lucide.

